	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z2"/>Ductus tua humanitate, pater in Christo colendissime, <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>has ad te pro ingenii mei modulo ac tenuitate <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>scripsi literas, quibus verbis saltem testatum apud <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>te relinquerem me vere et ex animo desiderare, ut <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>aliquando tuum in me plusquam paternum animum <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>re ipsa declarare liceat.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Certus itaque hoc tuo erga <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>me benevolo et paterno animo, haudquaquam dubitavi <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>tibi paucis negotium meum patefacere.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Cum <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>a magnifico senatu <placeName ref="l41">Bernensi</placeName> stipendium ad trien<lb xml:id="p1z11"/>nium rogassem, illud non omnino denegarunt; sed <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>iam, ut intelligo, hoc elapso anno cupiunt me <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>revocare.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Ego vero cum in sententia maneam, <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>nempe ut id mihi in triennium concedatur, amplissimum se<lb xml:id="p1z15"/>natum <placeName ref="l41">Bernensem</placeName> denuo rogavi, ut id mihi non denegetur; <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>non enim uno anno, quod volo ex <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>Hebraica lingua conoscere, possum assequi; nam <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>omne pulchrum difficile.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Ego autem, si adsit deus, <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>quantum in me erit, operam dabo, ne, et quod <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>in me conferunt beneficium, in ingratum con<lb xml:id="p1z21"/>tulisse iure queri possint et collati unquam <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>ipsos poenitere contingat.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Quamobrem <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>auxilium tuum, pater in Christo benignissime, sicut <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>et aliorum quorundam excellentium virorum rursum imploro, <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>u<lb xml:id="p1z26"/>t id nempe apud pastores et professores <lb xml:id="p1z27"/><placeName ref="l41">Bernenses</placeName> urgeas.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Hoc si feceris, non solum me <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>tibi in dies magis ac magis devinxeris, sed ipsi <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>etiam deo gratum praestiteris obsequium.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell"><lb xml:id="p1z30"/>Vale in Christo, mi observandissime domine et pater, mequ<lb xml:id="p1z31"/>e etiam, ut facis, semper ama.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Salutes velim nostro <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>nomine quam humanissime d. <persName ref="p8011">Gvalterum</persName>, d. <persName ref="p1884">Ludovicum <lb xml:id="p1z33"/>Lavaterum</persName>, d. <persName ref="p8442">Iosiam Simlerum</persName>, filios etiam amantissimos etc.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la" ana="salute"><lb xml:id="p1z34"/>Salutant vos plurimum d. d. <persName ref="p6836">Immanuel Tremellus</persName>, d. <lb xml:id="p1z35"/><persName>Ludovicus Masurius</persName><note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" n="1">Desmasures, derzeit Pfr. in Metz; s. Basel, Matrikel II 216, Nr. 61.</note> et reliqui boni viri.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Dominu<lb xml:id="p1z36"/>s te se<lb xml:id="p1z37"/>rvet.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Metis 4. idus mart[ii] 1564.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z38"/>Tuus semper <persName ref="p1566">Michael Hortinus</persName><lb xml:id="p1z39"/>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Clarissimo eruditissimoque <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>viro fideli Christi servo <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>et patri colendissimo d<lb xml:id="p2z4"/>omino <persName ref="p495">Henrico Bulingero</persName>, <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>ecclesiae <placeName ref="l587">Tigurinae</placeName> <lb xml:id="p2z6"/>vere fido pastori.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z7"/><placeName ref="l587">Tiguri</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
